[{"client_msg_id":"917b99ab-371a-4aa8-8073-89e08ddbdbf2","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"なるほどなー。","ts":"1627304676.406000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1bpDF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c9905169-5677-4573-b50c-0ea5ecfe314b","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/hayakawaseiich2/status/1419567578725306368\u003e","ts":"1627304673.405700","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/hayakawaseiich2|@hayakawaseiich2\u003e: ホビージャパンの件は何がまずいのかと言うと、\nあそこの会社は自社でプラモの販売も手掛けているので流通ともつながりがあります。\nつまり人気商品の流通情報を得ることも可能なのですね。そこの社員が転売を肯定したわけですから「こいつやってるな？」と思われ信用はがた落ち。首が当然。","id":1,"author_name":"早川清一朗@ライター","author_subname":"@hayakawaseiich2","author_link":"https://twitter.com/hayakawaseiich2/status/1419567578725306368","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1247680816731193345/W2T6DS4F_normal.jpg","text":"ホビージャパンの件は何がまずいのかと言うと、\nあそこの会社は自社でプラモの販売も手掛けているので流通ともつながりがあります。\nつまり人気商品の流通情報を得ることも可能なのですね。そこの社員が転売を肯定したわけですから「こいつやってるな？」と思われ信用はがた落ち。首が当然。","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1627286259,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/hayakawaseiich2/status/1419567578725306368","original_url":"https://twitter.com/hayakawaseiich2/status/1419567578725306368"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mZ4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"edc10c69-d54f-4e12-b4d4-f27a37e366cf","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"会社的に色々やらかしてるやつでこれがトドメになっただけ、が一番ありそうなんかな","ts":"1627302769.405100","edited":{"user":"U782D5DF1","ts":"1627302794.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Jqkv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bda741e4-1316-4c9d-b045-a08130a7137f","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"ホビージャパン、そういうツイートしたら怒る会社や個人が広告出しまくってるから\nス